<view class="wre-page">
  <view class="wre-card">
    <view class="wre-title">账户统一</view>
    <view class="wre-muted">网页端与小程序共用同一份阅读人格与昵称；从任一端开始用，都能在这里打通。</view>

    <view class="wre-muted link-loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">查询中…</view>

    <block wx:elif="{{myCode}}">
      <view class="link-sec">我的账户码</view>
      <view class="link-code">{{showFull ? myCode : myCodeMasked}}</view>
      <view class="link-code__ops">
        <text class="link-code__op" bindtap="onToggleCode">{{showFull ? '隐藏' : '显示完整'}}</text>
        <text class="link-code__op" bindtap="onCopyCode">复制</text>
      </view>
      <view class="wre-muted link-hint">
        在网页端「我的账户 → 跨设备登录」粘贴此码登录，两端即统一。账户码等同登录凭证，请勿转发他人。
      </view>
      <button class="wre-btn wre-btn--ghost" bindtap="onUnbind">解除关联</button>
    </block>

    <block wx:else>
      <view class="link-sec">情况一 · 我先在小程序使用</view>
      <button class="wre-btn" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="onEnsureCode">获取我的账户码</button>
      <view class="wre-muted link-hint">
        获取后可在网页端粘贴登录；本机已有的阅读人格会一并归入该账户。
      </view>

      <view class="link-sec">情况二 · 我已有网页端账户</view>
      <button class="wre-btn wre-btn--ghost link-scan" bindtap="onScan">扫一扫</button>
      <input
        class="link-input"
        type="text"
        placeholder="输入 6 位绑定码，或粘贴完整账户码"
        value="{{code}}"
        bindinput="onInput"
      />
      <button class="wre-btn" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="onSubmit">关联</button>
      <view class="wre-muted link-hint">
        在网页端「关联微信小程序」里点「生成绑定码」，用上方「扫一扫」扫二维码；也可手动输入 6 位数字，或粘贴完整账户码。
      </view>
    </block>

    <view class="link-status link-status--{{statusType}}" wx:if="{{statusText}}">{{statusText}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="wre-card">
    <view class="wre-title">说明</view>
    <view class="wre-help">1. 统一只建立两端身份映射，不涉及任何 Key。</view>
    <view class="wre-help">2. 统一后阅读人格与昵称两端共用；「我的纸书」仍按微信账号保存在本机。</view>
    <view class="wre-help">3. 可随时解除关联，解除后本机数据保留。</view>
  </view>
</view>
